"text":"for they will be a garland to grace your head, and chains around your neck."},{"verse":10,"text":"My son, if sinners entice you, don’t consent."},{"verse":11,"text":"If they say, “Come with us. Let’s lie in wait for blood. Let’s lurk secretly for the innocent without cause."},{"verse":12,"text":"Let’s swallow them up alive like Sheol, and whole, like those who go down into the pit."},{"verse":13,"text":"We’ll find all valuable wealth. We’ll fill our houses with plunder."},{"verse":14,"text":"You shall cast your lot among us. We’ll all have one purse”—"},{"verse":15,"text":"my son, don’t walk on the path with them. Keep your foot from their path,"},{"verse":16,"text":"for their feet run to evil. They hurry to shed blood."},{"verse":17,"text":"For the net is spread in vain in the sight of any bird;"},{"verse":18,"text":"but these lay in wait for their own blood. They lurk secretly for their own lives."},{"verse":19,"text":"So are the ways of everyone who is greedy for gain. It takes away the life of its owners."},{"verse":20,"text":"Wisdom calls aloud in the street. She utters her voice in the public squares."},{"verse":21,"text":"She calls at the head of noisy places. At the entrance of the city gates, she utters her words:"},{"verse":22,"text":"“How long, you simple ones, will you love simplicity? How long will mockers delight themselves in mockery, and fools hate knowledge?"},{"verse":23,"text":"Turn at my reproof. Behold, I will pour out my spirit on you. I will make known my words to you."},{"verse":24,"text":"Because I have called, and you have refused; I have stretched out my hand, and no one has paid attention;"},{"verse":25,"text":"but you have ignored all my counsel, and wanted none of my reproof;"},{"verse":26,"text":"I also will laugh at your disaster. I will mock when calamity overtakes you,"},{"verse":27,"text":"when calamity overtakes you like a storm, when your disaster comes on like a whirlwind, when distress and anguish come on you."},{"verse":28,"text":"Then they will call on me, but I will not answer. They will seek me diligently, but they will not find me,"},{"verse":29,"text":"because they hated knowledge, and didn’t choose the fear of the LORD."},{"verse":30,"text":"They wanted none of my counsel. They despised all my reproof."},{"verse":31,"text":"Therefore they will eat of the fruit of their own way, and be filled with their own schemes."},{"verse":32,"text":"For the backsliding of the simple will kill them. The careless ease of fools will destroy them."},{"verse":33,"text":"But whoever listens to me will dwell securely, and will be at ease, without fear of harm.”"}],"hasArtwork":false,"availableLangs":[]},{"id":"proverbs_3","bookSlug":"proverbs","chapter":3,"reference":"Proverbs 3","title":"Trusting Without Leaning on Your Own Sight","topics":["wisdom","guidance","trust","strength","peace","decisions","智慧","引導"],"snippet":{"en":"My son, don’t forget my teaching, but let your heart keep my commandments;","zh":"我兒，不要忘記我的法則；你心要謹守我的誡命；","zh-CN":"我儿，不要忘记我的法则；你心要谨守我的诫命；"},"tokens":{"trusting":1,"without":1,"leaning":1,"on":4,"your":8,"own":2,"sight":1,"wisdom":2,"guidance":2,"trust":2,"strength":1,"peace":1,"decisions":1,"智慧":2,"引導":2,"proverbs":4,"my":3,"son":1,"don":3,"forget":1,"teaching":1,"but":1,"let":2,"heart":3,"keep":1,"commandments":1,"kindness":1,"and":5,"truth":1,"forsake":1,"you":2,"bind":1,"them":2,"around":1,"neck":1,"write":1,"the":2,"tablet":1,"of":3,"in":2,"yahweh":1,"with":1,"all":2,"lean":1,"understanding":1,"ways":1,"acknowledge":2,"him":1,"he":1,"will":1,"make":1,"paths":1,"straight":1,"箴言":4,"我兒":2,"不要忘記我的法則":1,"你心要謹守我的誡命":1,"不可使慈愛":1,"誠實離開你":1,"要繫在你頸項上":1,"刻在你心版上":2,"你要專心仰賴耶和華":1,"不可倚靠自己的聰明":1,"在你一切所行的事上都要認定他":1,"他必指引你的路":2,"我儿":2,"不要忘记我的法则":1,"你心要谨守我的诫命":1,"不可使慈爱":1,"诚实离开你":1,"要系在你颈项上":1,"你要专心仰赖耶和华":1,"不可倚靠自己的聪明":1,"在你一切所行的事上都要认定他":1,"proverbios":1,"proverbes":1,"sprüche":1,"provérbios":1,"proverbi":1,"잠언":2,"वचन":1,"forms":1,"part":1,"father":1,"to":3,"child":1,"instruction":